  "why": "The Coliseum stands just past the near edge of the story's views, so their picture of today leaves it out (isoscape draws only buildings wholly inside the frame). A view framed further south was tried: the 1952 tracing stops partway across the Coliseum's site, and in Navy Hill the 1952 picture would draw today's streets, some laid out later, so this stop has no picture of 1952."
